(text "DLP-USB245C - USB-C, FT245RNL based, pin-compatible replacement for DLP-USB245M (24-pin, 0.6in DIP)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb6d699c-0eda-44cd-96cc-c1e82f01c268"))
(text "Connectivity is by net label: identical label names are the same net." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b2214efd-7061-476a-8bb5-393c7fe96ae1"))
(text "NOTES:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b97d0d86-ec3b-472c-893b-33f5a7e69745"))
(text "1. J1 pin 9 (SND/WUP) has no FT245R equivalent; left unconnected. Remote wake on FT245R = strobe RXF# low >=20ms while suspended." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a092715-061d-4b97-8065-893e99b04926"))
(text "2. J1 pin 4 RESETO# emulated by U3 (low until VCC>4.38V +120ms, then pulled to 3V3). Not driven by RESET# like the FT245BM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a0578e4b-7226-481e-9714-57ccbe87b9a1"))
(text "3. JP1/JP2 default OPEN = identical behaviour to original (user straps PORTVCC/EXTVCC/VCC-IO externally)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e38b078-3bfa-4449-a754-6ca4082fd121"))
(text "4. FT245R power pins modelled as passive to keep ERC free of PWR_FLAG noise. TEST and AGND tied to GND, OSCI/OSCO NC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 201.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a36d27e-e26b-4972-b856-1c3d508b0fa0"))
(text "5. Program FT245RNL EEPROM with FT_PROG: description string 'DLP-USB245M' if host software opens by description." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a9a3df5-efdd-4d39-b34e-ca6c894c81c9"))
